~ start
Impuls: Everybody stand still! I will protect the ecosystem!
do Gg.vis_bos()
Printer: Hello, who are you and why did you come here?
Impuls: Ah! I forgot to introduce myself! Hello, my name is Impuls.
Printer: Nice to meet you, I am Robert Printer.
Impuls: Do you happen to know of an evil printer that uses printed insects to destroy the ecosystem piece by piece?
Printer: So this is me.
Impuls: In that case, I'm sorry, but I have to kill you.
Printer: Ok, try it.
Impuls: Thanks for the permission.
do Gg.start_bos_2()
do Gg.vis_ui()
=> END